						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-slate-50" data-i18n="qa.feature.e2e.title">E2E Automation</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-400" data-i18n="qa.feature.e2e.desc">Automated end-to-end tests for complete AI agent workflows. Playwright and Selenium integrated.</p>
				</div>
			</Card>

			<Card variant="elevated" hover>
