						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-slate-50" data-i18n="qa.feature.reports.title">Report Generation</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-400" data-i18n="qa.feature.reports.desc">Detailed execution reports with evidence. Export to PDF, HTML, and Jira/Linear integrations.</p>
				</div>
