				</div>
				<div class="flex gap-4">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-saba-gradient text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold">3</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-50" data-i18n="qa.workflow.step3.title">Analyze Results</h3>
						<p class="text-slate-400" data-i18n="qa.workflow.step3.desc">Analyze quality metrics, detect regressions, and optimize coverage.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="flex gap-4">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-saba-gradient text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold">4</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-50" data-i18n="qa.workflow.step4.title">Iterate & Improve</h3>
